{"availability":"available","full":"Lain-Ego0/Lain-Ego0.github.io","name":"Lain-Ego0.github.io","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":21,"forks":6,"created":"2025-11-08T08:05:03Z","updated":"2026-09-30T11:41:40Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://lain-ego0.github.io/","topics":[],"demo":"https://lain-ego0.github.io/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T16:44:06.358Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T16:44:06.358Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T16:44:06.358Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T16:44:06.358Z","stars":21,"forks":6}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A pure front-end static single-page template suitable for personal homepages, portfolios, technical profiles, or project navigation pages. No backend and no build step are required. Download it, replace the copy and images, and it is ready to use.","The project entries, experiences, links, and images in this repository are demo content. Replace them with your own information before publishing."],"features":["Pure static single page: built only with HTML, CSS, and vanilla JavaScript. No Node.js, database, or server is required.","Data-driven rendering: projects, articles, timeline entries, tech stack items, and contact links are configured as arrays in assets/js/main.js for easy maintenance.","Multi-language support: English and Chinese language packs are included. Text is switched through lang/.json files and data-i18n attributes, and more languages can be added.","Light / dark theme: implemented with CSS custom properties, switchable with one click, and remembered through localStorage.","Responsive layout: adapts to desktop, tablet, and mobile. The navigation bar reflows on narrow screens."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Lain-Ego0/Lain-Ego0.github.io/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"397faccd02d208bd09a67f85d0078af37032663f79fab11d2b2e71be61b56a80","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T16:44:06.